al#:~:text=I%20was%20wounded%2C%20mortally%2C,more%20than%20us%3A%20Sidisi.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Sultai: Betrayal\" by Marcus Terrell Smith. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal-e5","summary":"Titsui explains the plan: Nishang will attend Dauna's ceremony for the newly undead carrying poisons from Sidisi in his new arm.","participants":["titsui-impersonator","nishang","dauna","sidisi"],"location":"gurmag-swamps","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal","order":415,"story_date":"2025-03-07","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":46,"quote":"Poisons gathered by Sidisi during her tenure of service to our master","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal#:~:text=Poisons%20gathered%20by%20Sidisi,service%20to%20our%20master","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Sultai: Betrayal","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Marcus Terrell Smith"],"date":"2025-03-07","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal#:~:text=Poisons%20gathered%20by%20Sidisi,service%20to%20our%20master","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Tarkir: Dragonstorm | Sultai: Betrayal\" by Marcus Terrell Smith. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 7 Mar 2025."}},{"id":"tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal-e6","summary":"Sidisi appears and Nishang swears to serve, offering a piece of his soul to seal the pact.","participants":["sidisi","nishang","titsui-impersonator"],"location":"gurmag-swamps","importance":"major","page":"stories/tarkir-dragonstorm-sultai-betrayal","order":415,"story_date":"2025-03-07","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"wizards","paragraph":54,"quote":"I will give anything and everythi